Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Full rebuild as Next 14 + TypeScript + React with output:'export': every page
prerenders to plain HTML, so crawlers and AI agents read the complete site
with zero JavaScript — the SPA trap avoided by construction.

Identity: dark laboratory. Phosphor traces on near-black, mono accents,
bench-gear panels — the deliberate opposite polarity of the light portfolio,
same geometry family (rounded sheet, pill buttons, cards).

Signature instrument: a three-phase oscilloscope driving a REAL droop model
(Δf = −f·0.04·ΔP, |df/dt| ≤ f·ΔP/2H). Drag load and inertia; the frequency
and RoCoF readouts come out of the integrator, not a faked curve.

Four locales (shared vg-locale key with the network), WebSite+Person JSON-LD,
the Grimaldi mark as component and favicon, vercel.json pinning the static
build for the 'Other' framework preset.
